        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Overwatch, Inside, Doom, Dark Souls III, The Last Guardian, Dishonored 2, Titanfall 2, Doom 3, Quake Live, Rage\n- People: Marty Stratton\n- Companies: ZeniMax Media, Bethesda Softworks\n- Concepts: 2016 video game awards, Doom franchise, series installments\n\nFacts:\n- In 2006, Marty Stratton became responsible for the overall development of Quake Live, Rage, and Doom with ZeniMax Media and Bethesda Softworks.\n- Doom is a reboot of the Doom franchise.\n- Doom is the fourth title in the main Doom series.\n- Doom was the first major Doom installment since Doom 3 in 2004.\n- In 2016, many awards went to games such as Overwatch, Inside, Doom, Dark Souls III, The Last Guardian, Dishonored 2, and Titanfall 2.",
